WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.340 --> 00:00:07.016
Use AI to turn a customer PDF into reviewable
drawings, a 3D model, and a material list.

2
00:00:07.036 --> 00:00:08.875
Spend less time redrawing.

3
00:00:10.220 --> 00:00:13.804
Start in FormToPart Studio with the original PDF.

4
00:00:13.824 --> 00:00:16.273
Select the plan and elevations you need.

5
00:00:17.210 --> 00:00:19.438
AI helps prepare 2D views.

6
00:00:19.458 --> 00:00:23.352
Compare them with the source and check dimensions
before moving into 3D.

7
00:00:26.220 --> 00:00:31.431
Rotate the model to see how the cabinet fits
together and inspect the parts from different
angles.

8
00:00:35.190 --> 00:00:37.509
Select a panel to see its material.

9
00:00:37.529 --> 00:00:40.839
Check the finish, thickness, and grain in the
board list.

10
00:00:42.180 --> 00:00:46.780
Review board sizes and quantities, then export
the cutting list to Excel.

11
00:00:49.170 --> 00:00:52.399
Try FormToPart Studio with your next PDF.
